~VERSION ---------------------------------------------------
 VERS.                 2.0 : CWLS LOG ASCII STANDARD - VERSION 2.0
 WRAP.                 NO  : ONE LINE PER DEPTH STEP
~WELL ------------------------------------------------------
 WELL.                 WELL_A    : Well name
 UWI .                 10-010-10001-00-00 : Unique Well Identifier
 STRT.M                2000.0  : Start depth
 STOP.M                2089.5  : Stop depth
 STEP.M                0.5     : Depth step
 NULL.                 -999.25 : Null value
 COMP.                 AfroPetro : Operator
 FLD .                 Nile Basin : Field
~CURVE ---------------------------------------------------------
 DEPT.M              : Measured Depth
 GR  .API            : Gamma Ray
 NPHI.V/V            : Neutron Porosity (fraction)
 RHOB.G/C3           : Bulk Density
 RT  .OHMM           : True Resistivity
 SW  .V/V            : Water Saturation (fraction)
